    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d898">

                <pb facs="1074" n="978" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg978"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 11,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Lord Tweeddale informs me Spanish Government have agreed to reopening Manila
                    office to be free to all telegrams of every kind. If you agree maintenance
                    steamer will be dispatched immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
